1
00:00:00,770 --> 00:00:02,650
(Leonard:)- No.
- You're making her uncomfortable.

2
00:00:02,855 --> 00:00:04,315
Did...? Oh, I'm sorry.

3
00:00:04,523 --> 00:00:08,363
(Sheldon:)Well, if it helps you feel any better,
you're doing very well so far.

4
00:00:08,611 --> 00:00:11,151
(Sheldon:)Next question. Are you fertile?

5
00:00:12,156 --> 00:00:13,696
(Penny:)- What?
- I'm trying to determine...

6
00:00:13,908 --> 00:00:16,408
...whether crying infants are a possibility.

7
00:00:16,619 --> 00:00:20,749
- I have no immediate plans.
- If that changes, let me know.

8
00:00:20,956 --> 00:00:24,336
(Sheldon:)- And finally, area rugs, pro or con?
- Pro?

9
00:00:24,543 --> 00:00:25,753
(Penny:)- Alicia?
- Yes?

10
00:00:25,961 --> 00:00:27,171
(Sheldon:)Welcome to the building.

11
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:39,180
(Alicia:)Thanks so much for helping me, Leonard.

12
00:00:39,392 --> 00:00:43,022
LEONARD: Thank you so much for
giving me the opportunity to help.

13
00:00:43,854 --> 00:00:45,524
(Penny(exiting apartment):)Oh, hey, guys.

14
00:00:45,731 --> 00:00:48,271
- Penny, this is Alicia, our new neighbor.
- Hi.

15
00:00:48,484 --> 00:00:49,524
(Sheldon:)Hi.

16
00:00:49,735 --> 00:00:51,615
(Leonard:)I'm helping.

17
00:00:52,196 --> 00:00:53,826
(Penny:)I can see.

18
00:00:54,031 --> 00:00:59,021
(Sheldon:)Alicia's non-musical,
childless and pro-rug.

